{#- The navigation's icons (implementation plan NAV-01): one inline SVG sprite, rendered once per page in nav_chrome
    (web only) and used by the bars through <svg><use href="#nav-i-…"></use></svg> - shared with the rail, the Menu and
    the top bar (NAV-03: search, help, Inbox, ☰, back, close search, scan; NAV-04/05: Feedback, the account menu's chevron). Outline + fill per place icon: CSS shows the
    filled twin on the current tab. Inline, never a font: font icons arrive late (font-display: swap) and would pop in on
    the bar. The symbol ids are the registry's Bootstrap Icons names (PlaceLink::symbol()); the paths are Bootstrap
    Icons 1.11 (MIT), viewBox 16 × 16. -#}
